{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00377",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 6.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "All set here, doctor. Chart's updated, and I'll read the readings out when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.58,
      "end_seconds": 11.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.72,
      "end_seconds": 19.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "So, um, so the thing is, I've got aching in my thighs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.56,
      "end_seconds": 24.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "How long has this been going on? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.24,
      "end_seconds": 30.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Probably two months. Yeah. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.78,
      "end_seconds": 34.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Does anything bring it on or make it worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.51,
      "end_seconds": 43.5,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "It's worse with climbing stairs. Weakness getting out of a chair was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.09,
      "end_seconds": 47.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.72,
      "end_seconds": 50.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.88,
      "end_seconds": 56.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any trouble swallowing, recent heavy exercise, numbness or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.06,
      "end_seconds": 61.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Uh, um, no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.41,
      "end_seconds": 64.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.03,
      "end_seconds": 67.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Uh, no fever, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.76,
      "end_seconds": 71.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.23,
      "end_seconds": 76.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 76.56,
      "end_seconds": 89.39,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Weight 61 kilos, height 163 centimetres. BMI works out to 23.0, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse is 83 beats a minute, pressure 116 over 72, temperature 36.4."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.78,
      "end_seconds": 106.01,
      "duration_seconds": 15.23,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.5,
      "end_seconds": 109.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.2,
      "end_seconds": 115.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.97,
      "end_seconds": 118.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Thyroxine, 75 micrograms, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.33,
      "end_seconds": 123.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.6,
      "end_seconds": 127.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Okay, um, so no, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.15,
      "end_seconds": 141.07,
      "duration_seconds": 12.92,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.1,
      "end_seconds": 144.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Right, um, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.98,
      "end_seconds": 148.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.57,
      "end_seconds": 151.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Hmm, my brother has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.33,
      "end_seconds": 168.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.16,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.02,
      "end_seconds": 171.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.94,
      "end_seconds": 174.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.13,
      "end_seconds": 185.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "Okay, so I've had an underactive thyroid for about ten years now. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.13,
      "end_seconds": 191.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.53,
      "end_seconds": 192.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.52,
      "end_seconds": 208.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Alright, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.1,
      "end_seconds": 214.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.78,
      "end_seconds": 219.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Alright, is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.96,
      "end_seconds": 224.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I, I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.37,
      "end_seconds": 231.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Okay, do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.81,
      "end_seconds": 236.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Well, I'm allergic to aspirin, I get wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.21,
      "end_seconds": 241.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.67,
      "end_seconds": 255.97,
      "duration_seconds": 14.3,
      "text": "Uh, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.19,
      "end_seconds": 261.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.56,
      "end_seconds": 265.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.02,
      "end_seconds": 285.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Power in the thighs is slightly reduced, four out of five."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.15,
      "end_seconds": 286.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.41,
      "end_seconds": 308.52,
      "duration_seconds": 16.11,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.85,
      "end_seconds": 312.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.81,
      "end_seconds": 332.56,
      "duration_seconds": 19.75,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with muscle symptoms that may be related to the cholesterol tablet. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had aching in your thighs for two months, and no fever or recent heavy exercise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.98,
      "end_seconds": 336.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Yes, you know, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.81,
      "end_seconds": 341.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.16,
      "end_seconds": 350.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "Uh, busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.68,
      "end_seconds": 376.33,
      "duration_seconds": 24.65,
      "text": "We should do a creatine kinase level for muscle pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for muscle weakness. Don't stop any of your tablets on your own, we'll decide after the blood test. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.87,
      "end_seconds": 384.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.62,
      "end_seconds": 386.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.26,
      "end_seconds": 399.27,
      "duration_seconds": 12.01,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. I'd like to see you again in two weeks. Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.19,
      "end_seconds": 404.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.2,
      "end_seconds": 411.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.48,
      "end_seconds": 414.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Well, I appreciate your time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}